return {
    ["        在黎明降临之前，因蒂斯被历史的阴影和现实的纷争笼罩。\n        直到1173年，罗塞尔·古斯塔夫高举革新的火光，带领这个国家走入了新的时代。他为这片混乱的土地带来新的秩序、律法与文明，将旧时代的腐朽肮脏全部涤清。\n        新的法律开始保障工人权益，义务教育让孩子们走入学堂，高等学校统一考试为国家培养人才，国家债券与基金的设立让因蒂斯的经济又一次复苏运转。《民法典》的光辉照耀在每个人的身上，就像破开迷雾的太阳。\n        因蒂斯首都特里尔又一次被欢笑与鲜花环绕，让我们赞美——\n        伟大的因蒂斯共和国！伟大的共和国执政官罗塞尔！"] = "        Before the dawn arrived, Intis was shrouded in the shadows of history and the disputes of reality. \n Until 1173, Roselle Gustav held high the torch of innovation and led this country into a new era. He brought new order, laws, and civilization to this chaotic land, cleansing all the decay and filth of the old era. \n New laws began to protect the rights of workers, compulsory education allowed children to enter schools, unified entrance examinations for higher education cultivated talents for the country, and the establishment of national bonds and funds allowed the Intis economy to recover and operate once again. The brilliance of the Civil Code shone upon everyone, like the sun breaking through the fog. \n The Intis capital, Trier, was once again surrounded by laughter and flowers. Let us praise— \n The great Intis Republic! The great Republic Consul Roselle!",
