    ["<DecH>工艺：</>水晶纱绉・辉光点染\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe · Radiance Dotted \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
